--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Architecture Diagram Generator — previews/architecture.html
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The architecture preview renders a MonoMind template whose visual system —
slate ground with a grid field, JetBrains Mono typography, the semantic
component palette — is derived from the Architecture Diagram Generator skill.
The template itself lives in the skill repository.

  Upstream:  https://github.com/Cocoon-AI/architecture-diagram-generator
  Author:    Cocoon AI
  License:   MIT
  Changes:   Derived, not copied. Rewritten as a MonoMind template: node colours
             moved from attributes to CSS classes so a theme is a token swap,
             a light palette added, English/Korean labels written inline, the
             MonoMind mark and chrome added, and the html2canvas/jsPDF exports
             replaced with print-to-PDF and a self-download so the file has no
             runtime dependency.


--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Slides AI Plugin onboarding deck — previews/slide-design.html
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The preview behind option five is proyecto26's own onboarding deck, rebranded.
The slide architecture, GSAP choreography, and animation work are theirs; the
palette, typography, mark, and copy are MonoMind's.

  Upstream:  https://proyecto26.com/slides-ai-plugin/
  Author:    proyecto26
  License:   MIT
  Changes:   Rebranded and rewritten to describe the design path as reached
             from this repository. The Prism theme (MIT) is inlined. GSAP is
             removed rather than bundled — it is "all rights reserved" under
             the GreenSock Standard License, and it was only performing two
             decorative entrances, which the Web Animations API does natively.
             The preview is self-contained apart from Google Fonts.
